Firefox source code
-------------------

Sorlyn is intended to be based on the Firefox open-source codebase, which is
published by Mozilla under the Mozilla Public License, version 2.0. At present,
this repository contains only Sorlyn's own documentation and project structure;
the Firefox upstream source has not been imported yet.

Once that source is imported, portions of Sorlyn will be derived from it. The
original Firefox source and its own notices, licenses, and attributions remain
